exit: 1
-- SYNTAX ----------------- errors/module_keyword_2.march

`module` is spelled `mod` in March: [module_keyword]

3 |   module Util do
      ^^^^^^

    mod Name do
        ...
    end

    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

3 -   module Util do
3 +   mod Util do

    run `march --explain module_keyword`

after fix: exit 0
